    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Excellent opportunity to rent a beautiful  4 bedroom  newly renovated first floor apartment.\r\nConveniently located in the heart of Nenagh town centre opposite Kenyon Street car park and close to Nenagh’s Railway station..\r\nReady for immediate occupancy and surprisingly spacious, this property is sure to impress. Don't miss out on the opportunity to rent  this fantastic residence comprising of 4 spacious Bedrooms, open plan kitchen  dining living room area, 2 bathrooms and a utility. The apartment has its own private access and comes fully furnished."
      },
